<title>SWEDEN: Handelsbanken sees 15 pct EPS increase.</title>
<headline>Handelsbanken sees 15 pct EPS increase.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish bank Handelsbanken said on Thursday its earnings per share would increase by at least 15 percent following the planned purchase of Swedish mortgage bank Stadshypotek.  </p>
<p>Bank chairman Arne Mortensen told a news conference the 15 percent increase would result even in the worst of circumstances.</p>
<p>&quot;Even in the worst case there will be a 15 percent increase in EPS,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>Handelsbanken earlier announced a 23 billion crown bid for Stadshypotek. -- Simon Haydon, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1004</p>
